s":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Ryou just got to the school, he saw Ai in front of his class, so he thought she was a classmate and tried to start a conversation with her. However, Ai screamed and ran away. However, from time to time, she shows up and sees Ryou in unexpected and embarrassing situations."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She's the school principal's, Taiga's daughter. Yukari infuriated her and when Ai tried to attack her, Yukari dodged, causing Ai to hit her head. Because Yukari convinced Taiga to not fuss over it, as it would make a scandal, the medical treatment was late, resulting in irreversible damage to Ai's brain. Ai has been in a coma for ten years already. What Ryou sees and talks to is actually her spirit which left her body."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Future: She's not mentioned in the prologue's future."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87265"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく出会い、よく言葉も交わすが、よく知らない少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトでもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"♀ばかりの学園に入学し、告白した全ての♀からOKして貰った事に、〝都合が良すぎる〟と言うが……"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22210","sourceWorkId":"28841","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"よく出会い、よく言葉も交わすが、よく知らない少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クラスメイトでもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"♀ばかりの学園に入学し、告白した全ての♀からOKして貰った事に、“都合が良すぎる”と言うが……"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74831"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/7948918eac3b0628165d681ed8bbf9048dc6cd9a5f161fc361fcd3d36d816b33.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e3293da6f1445494d0d10ef3bec69b8a64f36bcfb278d29197698e7d65b9b465.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡本理絵","creatorId":"vndb:s874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s874","name":"岡本 理絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:298585:74831:13368:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87266","characterName":"黛 眞優梨","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74832","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"298585"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22211"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87266"},"originalCharacterName":"黛 眞優梨","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ryou's cousin and the one who invites him to the \"super ojou-sama school\". She's always loved Ryou and she feels that this is the last chance she has to make him fall for her, even though she's too embarrassed to confess to him. Her childhood dream is to be a bride and marry Ryou."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She also is in love with Sakurako, but she doesn't realize it, nor want wants to, as it conflicts with her dream of marrying Ryou."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Future: In the prologue, she confesses she's marrying to someone because Yukari became Japan's president, and the law Yukari made forbidding weddings is about to come in effect. She also wanted Ryou to see her wearing a wedding dress."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87266"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の従妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"客観的に見れば可憐な美少女だが、幼い頃から知っているがゆえに遠慮がなく、態度もそれなり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女のあられも無い姿を目撃してしまった事で主人公の人生が揺れ動き、分岐していく事になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸の成長は完了済み。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22211","sourceWorkId":"28841","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の従妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"客観的に見れば可憐な美少女だが、幼い頃から知っているがゆえに遠慮がなく、態度もそれなり。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女のあられも無い姿を目撃してしまった事で主人公の人生が揺れ動き、分岐していく事になる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸の成長は完了済み。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74832"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/3844119804d01b2251db1c821cc813f9333b6e38f590c631d02c3e9223295d0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d2/d2b9a338ec1c0181f15a44c85df3fded57cb9736b7f461cb95836a59e6806fc5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"奥川久美子","creatorId":"vndb:s861","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s861","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s861","name":"奥川 久美子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:298585:74832:22331:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87267","characterName":"椹木 咲麗子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74833","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"298585"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22212"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87267"},"originalCharacterName":"椹木 咲麗子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mayuri's best friend and an antagonist toward Ryou. For various (obvious) reasons she dislikes Ryou in particular and men in general, and she and Ryou keep meeting despite both attempting to avoid the other."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In the common route it is revealed she is in love with Mayuri since childhood, as well as being heavily emotionally dependent on her presence in her life. While she does have a preference for women, she is actually bisexual, though her tendencies/habits born of education and upbringing have led her to fear and hate men. She was ready to give up on Mayuri but Ryou suddenly appeared and when she saw how much head over heels Mayuri was for Ryou, she became unwilling to give up."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Future: In the prologue's future, Mayuri told Ryou that Sakurako just bought a huge isolated mansion somewhere overseas and is still single."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87267"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"才色兼備で文武両道、初年度にして学生会の役員を務める、画に描いたような強気系美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜか自己評価が低い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"♂嫌いで共学化の撤回を求めている勢力に組みしており、主人公を目の敵にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眞優梨とは幼い頃からの親友。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22212","sourceWorkId":"28841","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"才色兼備で文武両道、初年度にして学生会の役員を務める、画に描いたような強気系美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なぜか自己評価が低い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"♂嫌いで共学化の撤回を求めている勢力に組みしており、主人公を目の敵にしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"眞優梨とは幼い頃からの親友。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74833"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ae/ae34ab94620aba6028d4c80752416e61fc939a89241aeaee288d186edc3d0f1f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/46/46401d488531b0708d843a463e772b710292ab59e1d72ce10ecb8245b4cdc211.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"由宇翼","creatorId":"vndb:s1420","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1420","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1420","name":"あさり☆","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:298585:74833:18193:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87268","characterName":"乙名 詩那","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74835","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"298585"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22213"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87268"},"originalCharacterName":"乙名 詩那","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl that passes the image of a wild beauty that does not belong to such high-class \"ojou-sama school\". Is always changing boyfriends, as well as very protective of her younger twin sister. There are some rumors that she's the principal's illegitimate daughter. On the first day, when Ryou started a conversation with her to try to become friends, she answered with \"Silence. Shut up. Get lost.\"."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She and her sister were used by Yukari to humiliate their mother by being filmed in embarrassing situations like of them peeing outside, masturbating, getting covered with semen, etc. only because Yukari was jealous of Taiga, who showed favoritism to the twins and their mother. However, on the day of the Storm, Ryou appeared and saved them when they were about to be sold as slaves. Even though Ryou lost the memories of that day, Shiina still remembers his voice, his back and the warmth of his his hug and considers him as her \"Knight in Shining Armor\". She's always changing boyfriends because she's looking for someone to protect her and her sister, even though said \"boyfriends\" just call themselves such because of her beauty and have no real or deeper relationship with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Future: In the prologue's future, Ryou and Mayuri remember the case where her twin classmates were kidnapped and killed. This case was so famous at the time that even Ryou, who almost never watched TV, still remembers about it."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87268"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"金髪に青と赤のカラコン、着崩した制服で不躾な言動と、お嬢様学園らしからぬ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ついでに胸と尻のサイズも派手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがしかし、所詮はお嬢様学園。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外部からやってきた主人公には微笑ましいレベルでしかない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カレシ持ちらしいが……"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22213","sourceWorkId":"28841","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"金髪に青と赤のカラコン、着崩した制服で不躾な言動と、お嬢様学園らしからぬ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ついでに胸と尻のサイズも派手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"だがしかし、所詮はお嬢様学園。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外部からやってきた主人公には微笑ましいレベルでしかない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カレシ持ちらしいが……"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74835"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f1/f1aa767e87a1b9859b17ee64e903cbd1c41b4342ba813fbb6e5883465a8f9617.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d7f08f561d2b5d8507e71e2c566d33360e726abd47b6b3498b4070c07e90d39.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"八ッ橋きなこ","creatorId":"vndb:s353","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s353","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s353","name":"八ッ橋きなこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:298585:74835:16170:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87270","characterName":"乙名 莉那","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74836","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"298585"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22214"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87270"},"originalCharacterName":"乙名 莉那","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shiina's younger sister. She lover her big sister and believes her sister is the best at everything. Since she saw Ryou on the first day of school, she always paying attention to him. She seems to be living a dream world where everything is always good, but only those close to her realize that she's not normal."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Because of the many years of sexual abuse and humiliation, she developed a fake personality that, although is similar to her original personality, for those close to her, is certainly not the same and overwrote her own memories of the day of the storm because of the trauma she suffered that day that day. However, even though she forgot about what happened that day, she still clearly remember Ryou and the fact that he saved them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Future: She's not directly mentioned in the prologue's future, but it said that she's missing and might have suffered the same thing as her sister."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87270"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは別のクラス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"艶やかな髪に減り張りのある体型と派手な見た目とは裏腹に態度は控えめで、存在感が薄い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親はおらず、母親は海の向こうで活躍しているアーティストだとか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"目立つがゆえの反動か、他人の目障りにならないような身のこなしが得意。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22214","sourceWorkId":"28841","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは別のクラス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"艶やかな髪に減り張りのある体型と派手な見た目とは裏腹に態度は控えめで、存在感が薄い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親はおらず、母親は海の向こうで活躍しているアーティストだとか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"目立つがゆえの反動か、他人の目障りにならないような身のこなしが得意。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74836"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/59/5993f6d905c5c7d101d60136abdc526b39fa50d3e72cd87118a9ade1556813ba.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e82eac76b9393f97a33c957aaec9921c520887d34efea3ebb8b4b04f19a866c.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水霧けいと","creatorId":"vndb:s955","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s955","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s955","name":"水桐 けいと","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:298585:74836:6173:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87271","characterName":"神尾 花梨","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74837","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"298585"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22215"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87271"},"originalCharacterName":"神尾 花梨","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The girl who sits next to Ryou. She's shy and has trouble communicating with people. Ryou finds her eyes beautiful but she's always covering them with her hair, so he can't see her face clearly. For some reason she's always distracted."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She's Mizuki's cousin, and because there are no young males in the clan, she was used as a \"breeding tool\" by the old men of the clan. Although she was saved before she lost her virginity, they bullied her to the point she became heavily addicted to pleasure and always has a toy inserted in her anus. Is in love with both Mizuki who saved her, and Ryou who saved Mizuki on the day of the storm."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Future: She's mentioned in the prologue's future as a girl that is so quiet, that she's gone before you notice, and there's always a lot of men surrounding her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87271"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じクラスで隣の席。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前髪に遮られて綺麗な瞳の他はよく見えないが、主人公は美少女であると確信している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極度に控えめで会話の成立が困難な程だが、♂を怖れている風ではなく、主人公への挨拶も欠かさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は緩い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22215","sourceWorkId":"28841","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じクラスで隣の席。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"前髪に遮られて綺麗な瞳の他はよく見えないが、主人公は美少女であると確信している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"極度に控えめで会話の成立が困難な程だが、♂を怖れている風ではなく、主人公への挨拶も欠かさない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は緩い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74837"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b8/b859d344c8649fd3f1557ddf05d57da04da3e9ba44f7293039f9ee6642b2b208.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec5a32c05dde7c246d0380eeb2192b4ac2da236e1dd20da92b24a80e528c9126.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浜田夏樹","creatorId":"vndb:s20635","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20635","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20635","name":"浜田夏樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:298585:74837:25250:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"木野原 さやか","creatorId":"vndb:s1452","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1452","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1452","name":"木野原 さやか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83351","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87272","characterName":"陵 瑞希","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"74838","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"298585"}],"egsCharacterIds":["22216"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87272"},"originalCharacterName":"陵 瑞希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"gender":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The first friend Ryou made when he enrolled in the new school. When they first met, Ryou assumed Mizuki was a girl. Mizuki very perceptive and understanding of a maiden's heart so Mizuki gives Ryou a lot of advice about girls while also promoting a relationship between them of more than friends. Mizuki's clan is know as the one who controls the city and is very strict, causing a lot of pressure to fall on Mizuki, resulting on Mizuki having ocasional violent anger outbursts."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Mizuki is a girl that was born with a penis, in other words, a hemaphrodite, a condition that is hereditary in her clan. However, while the male part can become erectile and ejaculate \"something alike semen\", it cannot impregnate women, and her female part is completely functional and fertile. Because of this she can't be considered a male, nor inherit the family's head position. Because there's no young male in the line of succession the clan to blames Mizuki for being born the way she did. On the day of the storm, she was saved by Ryou, who instantly realized she was a girl even tough she was dressed as a boy and treated her like a girl. She fell in love for him since."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Future: In the prologue's future, Mizuki isn't directly mentioned, but Mayuri says there were rumors about someone from that school that lost control in anger and killed a servant and was arrested..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87272"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"♀ばかりの中にあって唯一落ち着ける、心のオアシス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美形だが砕けた態度で接しやすく、主人公とも仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男装の美少女然とした容姿だが、♂トイレで視界をよぎったアレを確認済み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家庭の事情で自由が無い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22216","sourceWorkId":"28841","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"♀ばかりの中にあって唯一落ち着ける、心のオアシス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美形だが砕けた態度で接しやすく、主人公とも仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男装の美少女然とした容姿だが、♂トイレで視界をよぎったアレを確認済み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家庭の事情で自由が無い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"74838"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9e/9ecbb6c16a0cfe3c5d0f3be87252e3a257c29f32c74988a319fcd9e598b8594f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2d/2ddb4dc79d4f580e65bd413eac08c95bdda1f19045d1825d8bbd7b05afd90e03.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"よぴこ","creatorId":"vndb:s5259","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5259","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5259","name":"よぴこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:83352","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c87273","characterName":"弥刀 凉佑","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["22217"],"vndbCharacterId":"c87273"},"originalCharacterName":"弥刀 凉佑","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A salaryman who dragged himself along the bottom of a collapsing Japanese society until he managed to get himself run over by a truck. Upon dying, he is informed that he wasn't supposed to die yet, and he gets offered a chance to go back to before he made a certain choice that had the potential to alter his future."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His personality is cautious to the point of cowardice, and he retains all his experiences as an adult in his new life. However, since he wasn't interested in the world around him in life beyond avoiding trouble, he doesn't remember anything that might be useful to him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87273"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"元は、詰まらないトラブルを避けて何もしないでいたら人生そのものがが詰まらなくなってしまった、詰まらない♂だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"【天の声】の手違いで学生時代からやり直す羽目になり心機一転、今度は〝何もしない人生とは決別する!〟と意気込むが……"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"過去に戻れる可能性など本気で考えた事はなく、〝未来の記憶〟は大まかな世間の動向か直前の世間話ぐらいであり、学園生活には役立ちそうにない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親と離れて叔父の家に居候中。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"22217","sourceWorkId":"28841","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45617fe1dbd52f2294c611a7bb2865ff8240d1eef4ab68e51b3f1fbd07e98a1c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8a8dbeaa4511e39ed935446147ab5725c14932284a54fd43af90e91e632f3526.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:6397","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:6397","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:6397","name":"JADE","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:28841:6397","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p9863","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p9863","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p9863","name":"ジェイド","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:115844:v27068","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p9863","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p9863","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p9863","name":"ジェイド","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:75980:v27068","source":"vndb"}],"missingStates":[],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
